  "bodyHash": "nrg3YcQDBRk=",
  "content": "<h2>Этот мод добавляет рецепт для предметов, которые нельзя создать в стандартной версии Minecraft. Чтобы увидеть рецепт, посмотрите на картинку.</h2><p>Я настоятельно рекомендую вам использовать <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252frei%252fversion%252f18.0.804%2bfabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Roughly Enough Items (REI)</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmine-spawners%252fversion%252faMAMQxLy\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mine Spawners</a> и <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fobtainable-end\" rel=\"nofollow\">Obtainable End</a>, а также мой собственный мод <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbreakable-blocks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Breakable Blocks</a>.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/aada0ab88dd3aec82e2a9b6cc1a0707f38a8118b.png\" alt=\"title\"></p><hr><h1>Рецепт яиц спавна</h1><p>Все яйца спавна можно создать; тот же рецепт вы можете найти в <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fcraft-spawn-eggs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Craft Spawn Eggs</a></p><h3>Яйцо спавна Эндердрэгона</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5fe3102c6f9c94af9df9758a8864427ac0a10f41.jpeg\" alt=\"ed\"></p><h3>Яйцо спавна Уитера</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9be66dd9aab0feec9f29be61274edaaea9574633.png\" alt=\"ww\"></p><h3>Яйцо спавна медного голема</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c5cbf88d2a06acc6a3d87269f183cc30072ac97b.jpeg\" alt=\"медный голем\"></p><h3>Яйцо спавна верблюжьей шкуры</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/354fc19f2345de41595ccd3fa3a2b2b2abe76e73.jpeg\" alt=\"верблюжья шкура\"></p><h3>Яйцо спавна засушенному</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/047c71a30799cc01cd4803ac0f2b9197734417c8.jpeg\" alt=\"засушенное\"></p><h3>Яйцо спавна Наутилуса</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c08c454b9dee5ea1fa1b1a79740a571fa97e663f.jpeg\" alt=\"Наутилус\"></p><h3>Яйцо спавна зомби-наутилуса</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6d319afaa6d8f417d5f18cd66bcca44ef1bcda93.jpeg\" alt=\"наутилус Z\"></p><h1>Итемы и блоки</h1><h3>Тотем бессмертия</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/84807850dd73232807b42ad3bfb7f1b136ffdd1f.png\" alt=\"тотем\"></p><h3>Спавнер монстров</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1bcc3f4033071380475cf4b2872f6133ee66ba66.png\" alt=\"спавнер\"></p><h3>Зачарованное золотое яблоко</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/70ecc176db1f79dfa15ec43faa7d37cc6293dd60.png\" alt=\"эга\"></p><h3>Седло</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/339c9ce6d4ac65de9225937a6a6c37bbb67d2e2e.png\" alt=\"седло\"></p><h3>Элитра</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6a8e867bcec7364a48eff4c76a90c799ef9679f3.png\" alt=\"элитра\"></p><h3>Ярлык с именем</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/167926d00a5f785ac6bf17b0969107dde6dd2998.png\" alt=\"Ярлык с именем\">!</p><h3>Трезубец</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5b6f89594f7c95fa98200b981647baa066467e68.png\" alt=\"тр\"></p><h3>Рамка портала конца</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/af5ea409836e2281d9828da40ed4667d89587f41.png\" alt=\"конец\"></p><h1>Конская броня</h1><h3>Кожа</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c3f0ec052aaf228a5095670c46689ecd85473f00.png\" alt=\"л\"></p><h3>Железо</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/94d26a73f8a7bd5388a7421266b180d44169f1a9.png\" alt=\"и\"></p><h3>Медь</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/27d538f6112de59a5e1f9799f56b78734ad4d37a.jpeg\" alt=\"медная лошадь\"></p><h3>Золото</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4876047c5c27038997716c89729837143aa95555.png\" alt=\"г\"></p><h3>Алмаз</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/056605790622f9fa71cee068916b3557a9271561.png\" alt=\"д\"></p><h1>Броня Наутилус</h1><h3>Железо</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f4807c7e8b5e31c4404db1ca8e076c743ada1e1b_0.webp\" alt=\"наутилус железо\"></p><h3>Медь</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c43313ba71215a18e9377c0b1f4d9f5ea5ea8f50.jpeg\" alt=\"наутилус медь\"></p><h3>Золото</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f6e85460100d5ade67b44a7377ce2c5ecfde6b80.jpeg\" alt=\"наутилус золото\"></p><h3>Алмаз</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f6a06ffa6aea504102587d7153b0f90e501bca71.jpeg\" alt=\"наутилус д\"></p><h1>Цепная броня</h1><h3>Цепь</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e924f8202f9f6c86fac8d5f7bd46d09c9008d469.png\" alt=\"ц\"></p><h3>Шлем</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a4fe0bfe3f150b5d5ca6614be4ee9e23c62feddb.png\" alt=\"ш\"></p><h3>Кольчуга</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6aad186ee5ac469fa1898dc8990e09b8d8ea043f.png\" alt=\"к\"></p><h3>Леггинсы</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8381e5828c720f60520cc17fc67b7a8ce63c8662.png\" alt=\"л\"></p><h3>Сапоги</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/de70e6fa559f5717bdfcb66731e9d1cfb14adf99.png\" alt=\"с\"></p><h1>Незерит</h1><h3>Обновление Незерита</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1337a69ccdd8ac0f8a74639daa1e4df78a471dbb.png\" alt=\"н1\"></p><h3>Меч</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3ac1be519ff7b1e6b1577a28a1e4bbf9e770d5d3.png\" alt=\"н2\"></p><h3>Лопата</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0a3b824ebb494a986c56405d4dc234bb7ccde11d.png\" alt=\"н3\"></p><h3>Кирка</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e863dc945f77d1d66025c0dc9093d639765b281a.png\" alt=\"н4\"></p><h3>Топор</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/51a7d0f98b00e84a83b1c479e944a6227adfef2b.png\" alt=\"н5\"></p><h3>Мотыга</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c6edcde7f132dce5841b46764121c046c5a360b.png\" alt=\"n6\"></p><h3>Шлем</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6f8d5989c6df493023a3f1e617b7559ffb128e77.png\" alt=\"n7\"></p><h3>Кольчуга</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/75749b034fb9b50e42ea5dd7204b0c68e62a170e.png\" alt=\"n8\"></p><h3>Леггинсы</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1aabb8d2e55d8c4b8fe438beb1ecb4aadce5eb41.png\" alt=\"n9\"></p><h3>Сапоги</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5e3c331db00b3b4a96f06a065adf199a10e77607.png\" alt=\"n10\"></p>",
